<title>ITALY: Mediobanca half year result down.</title>
<headline>Mediobanca half year result down.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>    Parent pre-tax profit   95.471 vs     100.395</p>
<p>    Net interest income    329.7   vs     455.368</p>
<p>    Gross operating result 271.7   vs     449.983</p>
<p>Note - Mediobanca said the pre-tax profit was after setting aside a total 162 billion lire.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
